<title>USA: BPA offers only peak firm power for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>BPA offers only peak firm power for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) offered only peak, firm power for Tuesday pre-schedulings, the agency said Monday.</p>
<p>BPA offered 300 MW of peak firm power at $18.00 per megawatt hour for Northwest deliveries and $20.00 for California-Oregon border (COB) sales.</p>
<p>The prices were up $1.00 per MWh from prices for power delivered on Monday.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau, +1 213 955 6761))</p>
